### 1. Public weather list(Guest)
GET http://localhost:5000/weather

### 2. Single day detailed forecast(User / Admin)
POST http://localhost:5000/weather/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "luid": 3
}

### 3. Admin weather list(All details)
POST http://localhost:5000/admin/weather
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "luid": 1
}

### 4. Create new forecast(Admin)
POST http://localhost:5000/admin/weather/new
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "luid": 1,
  "date": "2026-07-01",
  "location": "Balaton",
  "temp_min": 20,
  "temp_max": 33,
  "weather_type": "Napos",
  "precipitation": 0,
  "precipitation_probability": 5,
  "wind_speed": 10,
  "wind_direction": "D",
  "humidity": 60,
  "pressure": 1015,
  "uv_index": 9
}